sentences.text:
The motivating case is sensory and executive overload in autistic adults, who
report sensory reactivity differences across modalities \cite{maclennan2022}
and in whom sensory atypicality tracks executive difficulty \cite{kiep2025};
meta-analysis finds executive dysfunction across the spectrum, with smaller
effect sizes in adults \cite{demetriou2018}.
